{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Fang Over Fang has a 20% chance per Bloodfang Bite to reset Reave (#578)",
  "contract": "Fang Over Fang 504116 is a passive SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL (aura 42) on 504117, the SPELL_EFFECT_ASCENSION_RESET_COOLDOWN payload bloodmage-fang-over-fang-reave-reset.json already proves deterministic. That scenario documents the half it cannot cover: Spell.dbc gives 504116 ProcFlags 0 and no spell_proc row existed before rev_20260920_57_bloodmage_fang_over_fang_proc.sql, so SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs generated nothing and the aura was inert; the row's own Chance is 0, deferring to Spell.dbc's ProcChance 20 (rev_20260919_20_coa_proc_chance_parity.sql), scoped to Bloodfang Bite by SpellFamilyName 26 and SpellFamilyMask1 8388608 (all ten ranks 501695-501697, 503613-503615, 572549-572551, 800156), ProcFlags 16 (PROC_FLAG_DONE_SPELL_MELEE_DMG_CLASS) and SpellPhaseMask 1 (PROC_SPELL_PHASE_CAST), so the roll happens on cast, independent of hit or miss. 572551 is the rank a level-80 character owns per AscensionSpellProgressionData.h's Bloodfang Bite progression (top rank at level 60, unchanged through 80); it needs a Cursed Form for its CasterAuraSpell 525031, supplied here the same way bloodmage-petrified-legions-darkwing.json supplies it, by fixturing Eternal Curse 800157 (the module syncs the marker onto 525031). Each bite costs 300 rage units (30 Rage), refilled before every cast. spell_proc_count(spell=504116) records every cast with Fang Over Fang named as its triggering aura (CoAGameplayTestProcCounter::OnSpellCast reads Spell::GetTriggeredByAuraSpellInfo(), which is 504116, the aura, not 504117, the payload it casts) - the same convention bloodmage-petrified-legions-darkwing.json uses for its own aura/payload pair. At the record's own 20 percent chance, 31 connecting bites leave 0.8^31, about 0.0990 percent, chance that a correctly fixed build records zero procs; a build without the spell_proc row (the state before rev_20260920_57) records zero every time, so the assertion also fails against that prior state. spell_cast_count(spell=572551) proves all 31 trials were genuine completed casts, not GCD- or rage-starved rejections, independent of the proc outcome.",
